@startuml
title SD-S04 — Product visibility and gallery
caption FN-CAT-01–04 · To-Be · Catalogue ownership
[*] --> Draft : create
Draft --> Listed : validate required catalogue data
Listed --> Unlisted : unpublish
Listed --> Suspended : pause orders
Listed --> SoldOut : mark sold out
Unlisted --> Listed : republish
Suspended --> Listed : resume
SoldOut --> Listed : restore sellability
Draft --> Archived : archive
Unlisted --> Archived : archive
Suspended --> Archived : archive
SoldOut --> Archived : archive
Listed --> Archived : archive
note right of Archived : Historic order snapshot retained
note right of Listed : Only current attached photos serve customer reads
@enduml
